# Keeping patterns: the oscillators and the still lifes of a rule in panels of their own, the
# spaceships in the spaceship list. Expects the default start-up (single rotation, 256×256).
# A scripted run has no file for what it keeps, which is gone when it ends.
wait 25; clear

# The two panels open from the pattern card, and say that nothing is kept yet.
click Oscillators; wait 6; expect_shown KeptOscillators on
expect_text KeptOscillatorsNote None kept under this rule yet. Keep, in the analysis panel, puts a pattern here.
click StillLifes; wait 6; expect_shown KeptStillLifes on
shot kept-1-empty
click Oscillators; wait 4; click StillLifes; wait 4
expect_shown KeptOscillators off; expect_shown KeptStillLifes off

# A still life, typed into the analysis panel. Keep is there for what comes back to its shape
# as one thing, and says whether that is kept; a second click lets go of it again.
key a; wait 8
click StudyText; wait 3; type $2o$2o; wait 3
until expect_text StudyWhat WHAT Still life
expect_text AnalysisKeep Keep
click AnalysisKeep; wait 6
expect_text AnalysisKeep Kept
expect_text AnalysisNote Kept among the still lifes of its rule.
click AnalysisKeep; wait 6
expect_text AnalysisKeep Keep
expect_text AnalysisNote Let go of: it is no longer among the still lifes kept.
click AnalysisKeep; wait 6
# It is in the panel of the still lifes, with a glass for a closer look and its mark.
click StillLifes; wait 8
expect_shown KeptStillLife0 on; expect_shown KeptStillLifeLook0 on
expect_text KeptStillLifesNote Click a pattern to pick it up. Its mark lets go of it.
shot kept-2-a-still-life
click StillLifes; wait 4

# An oscillator and a spaceship go where they belong.
click StudyText; wait 3; key Ctrl+a; type o; wait 3
until expect_text StudyWhat WHAT Oscillator
click AnalysisKeep; wait 6
expect_text AnalysisNote Kept among the oscillators of its rule.
click StudyText; wait 3; key Ctrl+a; type $2o2$2o; wait 3
until expect_text StudyWhat WHAT Spaceship c/6 orthogonal →
click AnalysisKeep; wait 6
expect_text AnalysisNote Kept among the spaceships of its rule.

# Four patterns at once come apart into pieces: three ships and a block. Keep all, on their
# line, keeps every kind of them, without the list being open; two were kept already.
key Escape; wait 3; clear
place 2o$2o 96 105; place 3o$o$bo 100 100; place o$o2$o$o 110 100; place $2o2$2o 120 100
click Analyse; wait 3; drag Grid -110 -110; wait 20
until expect_text StudyPieces 4 pieces
expect_shown AnalysisKeep off
expect_text PieceSort0 3 SPACESHIPS c/15, c/6, c/184
expect_text PieceSort1 1 STILL LIFE
click PiecesKeep; wait 6
expect_text AnalysisNote Kept 2 kinds of piece, and 2 were kept already.
expect_shown PiecesList on; expect_shown PieceSort0 on
shot kept-3-pieces
# In the list every kind has its mark, which lets go of it and keeps it again.
click PiecesToggle; wait 6
click PieceKeep0; wait 6
shot kept-4-listed
click PieceKeep0; wait 6
click PiecesToggle; wait 4
key Escape; wait 3; key a; wait 6
expect_shown Analysis off

# The spaceships that were kept are in the spaceship list before any is caught, and one that
# is caught is counted there.
clear; key s; wait 10
expect_shown Catcher on; expect_caught 0 0
expect_shown Kind0 on; expect_shown Kind2 on
shot kept-5-known
place $2o2$2o 240 120
key k; wait 6; step 120; wait 10
expect_caught 1 1; expect_text Kind0 12 4 1 c/6 orthogonal
# A mark in the list lets go of a kind; Keep all keeps them all again. Clearing the list
# forgets what was caught, and leaves what is kept.
click KeepKind0; wait 6
click CatcherKeepAll; wait 6
expect_text CatcherNote Kept 1 more, and 2 were kept already.
click CatcherForget; wait 20; expect_caught 0 0; expect_shown Kind2 on
key k; wait 3; key s; wait 4

# A click on a kept pattern picks it up, to be put down on the grid; its mark lets go of it.
click Oscillators; wait 8
expect_shown KeptOscillator0 on
click KeptOscillator0; wait 3; click Grid 0 0; wait 3; expect_population 1
key Escape; wait 3
click KeptOscillatorForget0; wait 8
expect_text KeptOscillatorsNote None kept under this rule yet. Keep, in the analysis panel, puts a pattern here.
# Under another rule there are other patterns: none yet.
click StillLifes; wait 8; expect_shown KeptStillLife0 on
rule critters; wait 8
expect_text KeptStillLifesNote None kept under this rule yet. Keep, in the analysis panel, puts a pattern here.
shot kept-6-another-rule
quit
